{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065229/block/singleImage/3275345/df/1609090282_3L.jpg?updatedAt=1795421806\"/><figcaption>聯合醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>觀塘翠屏北邨發生虐兒案。 今日（23日）中午12時28分，一名女子前往觀塘翠屏北邨翠楣樓一個單位內探訪其7歲兒子時，發現其分居丈夫不在單位內，兒子被獨留在家，於是報警。警方及救護員接報後趕至現場，發現男童眼部紅腫，由救護車將他送往聯合醫院檢查。警方將案件列「疏忽照顧」跟進，暫時未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:43:51.532204+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:16:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T20:13:45.540998+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:37:15.949095+00:00","content_hash":"498f47360a371a2eb21a57aca881eb59cfc5577fa70b32ca588285e0df344925","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:43:51.532204+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}